menu "Night Sentinel alerts"

    config NS_AUDIO_ENABLED
        bool "Speak the warning on the speaker"
        default y
        help
            Turn off to test at night without waking the house. Detection, push and SD
            evidence still work.

    config NS_AUDIO_GAIN_PCT
        int "Speaker volume, percent of the recorded level"
        range 0 400
        default 100
        help
            Above 100 the clip gets louder but its peaks start to clip. Lower it if the board
            resets during playback (brown-out from IR LEDs + Wi-Fi + speaker together).

endmenu
